## 2. Full Frontmatter Field Reference

| Field | Required | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `title` | yes | string | H1, also page `<title>` |
| `excerpt` | yes | string | Listing cards, meta description, OG/Twitter description |
| `date` | yes | string (`YYYY-MM-DD`) | Published date |
| `author` | yes | string | `"ri-mirelle"` or `"jyoti-mirelle"` (recommended) — see §7 for all accepted formats |
| `category` | yes | string | Shown above H1, used for `?category=` filtering |
| `image` | yes | string (path) | Hero image. **Must be 1200×675 (16:9)** — Discover hero spec, do NOT use /blog's 1200×630 |
| `imageAlt` | yes | string | Alt text |
| `imageWidth` / `imageHeight` | yes | number | Should be `1200` / `675` |
| `readTime` | yes | string | e.g. `"3 min"` |
| `topic` | yes | string | Data field only — **never** a URL segment. URLs are flat: `/nail-feed/[slug]` |
| `canonical` | yes | string | Full canonical URL |
| `dateModified` | no | string | Defaults to `date` if omitted |
| `tldr` | no | object | See §3 |
| `faqItems` | no | array | See §4 |
| `topicalMap` | no | object | See §5 (trimmed shape — 5 fields only) |
| `reaction` | no | object | See §6.1 |
| `poll` | no | object | See §6.2 |
| `quiz` | no | object | See §6.3 |

