## 10. What NOT to Carry Over From /blog

These fields/components exist on `/blog` but are deliberately excluded
here. Don't re-add without a real, named scope change:

**Fields**: `showInspoGalleryLink`, full `topicalMap` (trimmed version
kept, see §5), `template` (one template only), `tutorialMetadata`,
`videoMetadata`, `eventData`, `carouselImages`, `products`, `heroImages`
(plural — Nail Feed has one hero image).

**Components**: `DownloadButton`, `AffiliateBanner`, `ImageCarousel`,
`ProductGrid`, `ProductCard`, `Lightbox`.

**URL structure**: flat only — `/nail-feed/[slug]`, never
`/nail-feed/[topic]/[slug]`. `topic` is frontmatter data, never a URL
segment.

